        "created_at": "2015-06-11T00:44:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I recently adopted Tactics and it's first expansion from a friend who it just didn't click with because he needed to recoup some cash. He is very gentle with his games and everything looks to be there and in good shape, but I want to double check. Is there a more detailed contents list floating around somewhere on the net? Like X cards in X deck and X health tokens? While I trust it to all be there this would help my peace of mind.</p>",
